<section class="section faq-section" id="faq"><div class="container"><div class="section-head reveal"><div><span class="eyebrow">FAQ</span><h2 class="h2">Before you start a project with Ferrn.</h2></div><p class="lead">Straight answers to the questions we hear most often before a website, web app or AI project begins.</p></div><div class="faq-list reveal"><?php $faqs=[['What kinds of projects do you take on?','We focus on conversion-focused websites, custom web applications, portals, dashboards and practical AI automation. If the project does not clearly improve trust, revenue, efficiency or visibility, we will usually tell you that before we build anything.'],['How much does a project cost?','Website projects typically start in the low thousands of dollars, while custom applications and AI systems vary based on scope, integrations, users and complexity. We scope the problem first, then recommend the smallest useful solution.'],['How long does a typical project take?','Focused websites can often be delivered in a few weeks. Larger web applications and AI systems are usually delivered in milestones so you can review progress and start learning before the entire roadmap is complete.'],['Can you work with our existing brand or product team?','Yes. We can work as the full strategy-design-development team or plug into an existing internal team where design, frontend, backend or product support is needed.'],['Do you provide support after launch?','Yes. Depending on the project, we can provide post-launch support, maintenance, iteration and ongoing product development.'],['What do you need from us to get started?','You do not need a perfect brief. We need the business problem, the people affected by it, what you have tried already and what a successful outcome would look like. We can help define the rest.']];foreach($faqs as $i=>$f):?><article class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" data-faq-toggle aria-expanded="false"><span><?=htmlspecialchars($f[0])?